[41.629024, "o", "\u001b[1;36mSame requests. Fixed server. Measured results.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nMetric                         Original       Replay\r\nCommitted responses                 400          400\r\nHTTP errors                         194            0\r\nFailed health requests               65            0\r\np95 response latency           155.5 ms      32.0 ms\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;32mAll acceptance checks passed.\u001b[0m\r\nSaved request hashes and offsets match across both runs.\r\nResults read from Iceberg; retained Iggy capture checked again.\r\n\r\nTry it: github.com/gordonmurray/iggy-flink-traffic-replay\r\ngit clone https://github.com/gordonmurray/iggy-flink-traffic-replay.git\r\ncd iggy-flink-traffic-replay && make run\r\n"]
